Date: Sat, 26 Sep 2026 06:37:36 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Implement audit report fixes + Rule 4 follow-up-due
 notifications

Security (closes the report's NOT-FIXED items):
- Refresh-token rotation + server-side revocation (refresh_sessions
  table, family reuse-detection, POST /auth/logout, revocation on
  user deactivation, daily cleanup job)
- Login rate limiting: sliding-window 429+Retry-After per
  (IP+canonical mobile) and per IP
- Canonical user identity: users.mobile_normalized (unique, backfilled,
  auto-synced via ORM event); login works with any equivalent mobile form
- Scheduler jobs guarded by pg advisory locks (multi-worker safe)
- Audit-log write failures now logged structurally (app_logger.exception)
- Uniform 401 for inactive-account logins (no account-state enumeration)
- DEBUG=False default; SECRET_KEY < 32 bytes fails startup
- CI workflow (pytest on PostgreSQL 15 service + oxlint + vite build)
- TLS/ingress + multi-replica deployment docs in backend/README.md

Audit fixes that were missing from this repo:
- Alembic baseline downgrade now raises (was: dropped production tables)
- e84148be659e downgrade preserves parent columns (created_at/is_active)
- ETag responses Vary: Authorization (200 + 304 paths)
- Dashboard analytics on Tehran calendar-day boundaries; date-only
  date_to inclusive at the API boundary (Gregorian + Jalali)
- DB-aware GET /health + Docker/Compose healthchecks switched to it
- Orphaned-upload cleanup when create_attachment() fails
- get_notifications excludes soft-deleted leads and canceled tasks
- Security headers extracted to app/middleware/security_headers.py
- jdatetime 5.0.0 -> 5.3.0; .env.example hardened; vercel.json newline
- Frontend: epoch-namespaced request cache, cross-tab auth sync via
  storage events, rotated refresh token persisted, server-side logout

Feature (Rule 4, merged surgically from the fix-notis package onto the
post-audit baseline so BIGINT/index/advisory-lock fixes are kept):
- follow_up_notified one-shot flag + migration b7c4d9e1a203 (retargeted
  to current head b7c8d9e0f1a2)
- check_due_followups job (every 5 min, per-lead error isolation)
- Flag reset in create_activity + update_lead_followup
- follow_up_due type in NotificationBell/NotificationCenter UI

Tests: 198 passed on live PostgreSQL 15 (fresh upgrade head -> seed ->
full suite); frontend npm ci + build + lint with 0 errors.
New: tests/test_refresh_rotation.py (11), tests/test_audit_unit_regressions.py (20),
tests/test_followup_due_reminders.py (5).
